coach "Ground and Pound"
about "Run it, run it again, play-action off it, and blitz on defense."

offense:
  when game ending and leading by over 0 and clock under 100 -> kneel
  when fourth down and to go under 2 -> call "QB Sneak" or "Power"
  when fourth down and to go over 6 -> call "Four Verticals" or "Smash" or "Mesh"
  when fourth down -> call "Slants" or "Inside Zone" or "Curl Flat"
  when third down and to go over 8 -> call "Smash" or "Curl Flat" or "PA Deep Shot"
  when first down and last play gained over 5 and chance 40% -> call "PA Deep Shot"
  otherwise -> call "Inside Zone" or "Power" or "Toss Sweep" or "Inside Zone" or "Draw"

defense:
  when they pass over 60% -> call "Cover 2" or "Cover 3"
  when third down and to go over 6 -> call "Cover 1" or "Cover 3"
  otherwise -> call "Run Blitz" or "Cover 1" or "Cover 0 Blitz"

lineup:
  QB "Game Manager"
  RB "Power Back"
  WR "Possession Receiver"
  TE "Blocking TE"
  OL "Road Grader"
  DL "Bull Rusher"
  LB "Thumper"
  CB "Shutdown Corner"
  S "Enforcer"
